# 统一换行符：仓库内与工作区都用 LF，避免 Windows/Linux 协作产生 CRLF 噪声
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
*.ts  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
